    "OT_VERSE_REF": "Jeremiah 16:16",
    "OT_VERSE_SNIPPET": "I will send for many hunters, and they shall hunt them from every mountain...",
    "NT_VERSE_REF": "Luke 11:54",
    "NT_VERSE_SNIPPET": "...laying wait for him, and seeking to catch something out of his mouth...",
    "OT_VERSE_LINE": "Jeremiah 16:16 — “I will send for many hunters, and they shall hunt them from every mountain...”",
    "NT_VERSE_LINE": "Luke 11:54 — “...laying wait for him, and seeking to catch something out of his mouth...”",
    "GREEK": "θηρεύω",
